note.p:
Source: Department of State, Central Files, 611.51/9–2459. Secret; Priority;
                    Presidential Handling. Drafted in the White House, cleared by Goodpaster, and
                    approved by Calhoun.

For text of Herter’s statement on September 22 in support of de Gaulle’s program
                    for Algeria, see Department of State Bulletin,
                    October 12, 1959, pp. 500–501.
